# The omx-dsp commit tools/live-owner-data.sh proves this tree against, until the release named (omx-contract#195).
# This tree spells the units by their PARAM_UNITS ids (percent, dBPerOct, dBPerS, coef: e1c506d) and omx-dsp's latest
# release, v0.34.0, still writes %, dB/oct and x, so its data cannot validate here; the omx-dsp that speaks the ids
# build-requires this omx-contract, so omx-contract publishes first. 759e8f7 is the omx-dsp chain-6 head (omx-dsp#148,
# with #143: the leveler's and the balancer's speed travel in dBPerS), released as 0.34.1. From omx-dsp v0.34.1 on the
# script reads the latest release; the release after that removes this file.
759e8f745f936dab73721dafad24c3bd269aa8ad until v0.34.1
